t;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wF_v!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb482897-8a49-42d3-b094-88a7ecd72716_1594x829.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wF_v!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb482897-8a49-42d3-b094-88a7ecd72716_1594x829.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wF_v!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb482897-8a49-42d3-b094-88a7ecd72716_1594x829.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wF_v!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbb482897-8a49-42d3-b094-88a7ecd72716_1594x829.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p>This afternoon at the UN Security Council, Yoshua Bengio, Sam Altman, Dario Amodei, and Hugging Face CEO and Cofounder Clement Delangue gave back-to-back speeches.</p><p>I absolutely loved Bengio&#8217;s, agreeing with virtually every well-crafted word, and, with his permission, am reprinting his remarks in full, below. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"833\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:833,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:411554,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/217140643?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!o-j6!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F200fe44c-3100-431d-a1ee-03769f94f835_2420x1384.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The more surprising thing is that I agreed with almost all of what the other three said as well (and most of what followed, as many other speakers from around the world gave their own remarks).<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a> </p><p>Pretty much everyone converged on exactly the same things I keep harping on:</p><ul><li><p><strong>The need for preflight safety testing.</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>The need for transparency auditing.</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>The need for liability.</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>The need for global dialogue and international cooperation.</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>The need for immediate action.</strong></p></li></ul><p>At this point, with leading scientists (like Bengio) and major CEOs all reaching consensus, there is no excuse not to start implementing them.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/historic-un-security-council-briefing?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/p/historic-un-security-council-briefing?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><p><em>Here are Yoshua Bengio&#8217;s beautiful and important remarks. Humanity will regret it if we do not take heed.</em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png\" width=\"1055\" height=\"1301\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1301,&quot;width&quot;:1055,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:300747,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/217140643?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8e7783c7-e2ac-437d-a364-00a04c5024ee_1173x1332.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F328dff12-35f0-4dfc-b1c1-ba3be74650c3_1055x1301.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!PUYM!,w_848