1-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FB33!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FB33!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png\" width=\"1029\" height=\"556\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:556,&quot;width&quot;:1029,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:122809,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/i/217140643?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Faedc0b71-f480-4bd6-9017-8adf76387345_1162x646.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FB33!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FB33!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FB33!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FB33!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F19f1181a-4c71-4a7e-96e5-db598d44e66c_1029x556.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><em>The full session (which starts several minutes into the recording) can be viewed <a href=\"https://transcripts.un.org/en/sc/10228\">here</a>. A transcript will be available at the same location.</em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://garymarcus.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>The only real false note came from some self-congratulatory hype in the speeches of Altman and Amodei, especially Amodei&#8217;s. Amodei in particular overhyped a <a href=\"https://x.com/darioamodei/status/2102831170299834652?s=61\">discovery announced early today, in enzymes,</a> which Amodei prematurely tried to liken to the truly revolutionary gene editing system CRISPR.  In reality, as <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Dr. Angela Rasmussen&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:18160212,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;user&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!tEnQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F289f1fe2-dfd3-41d6-9432-b910eec8ca7d_896x898.jpeg&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;036c8ef7-0f6b-4367-9917-020fb9074648&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span>, put it  &#8220;They found the sequence, probably expressed a protein, but haven&#8217;t done any meaningful functional characterization&#8230; It&#8217;s not bad, it&#8217;s just very premature to compare to CRISPR.&#8221;  </p><p></p></div></div>",
